#     deposit exists; this file cites the concept DOI until then.
# The concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23053317 resolves to the newest archived
# version. There is no archived v0.1.1 release. The initial source commit
# a65c8f3 (the revision behind the first measurement tables) is preserved by
# the archive/initial-commit tag; the public v0.1.0 tag points to dd0d0b1.
